<h2><strong>Baptism</strong></h2>
        <p> This is a sacred rite of initiation and gateway into becoming a full fleshed member of Celestial Church of
          Christ and which involves immersion in water in the name of God the father, the son and of the Holy
          Spirit which could also mean genuine repentance and Spiritual cleansing.
          REQUIREMENTS BEFORE BAPTISM
        <p>1. He/she must have been worshiping in the church for not more than one year and must adhered
          to the rules and regulations of the church</p>
        <p>2. Must accept Jesus Christ as his/her Lord and Saviour</p>
        <p> 3. Must undergo a brief training on <strong>THE IMPORTANCE OF BAPTISM</strong></p>
        <p>4. Must renounce all secret cults, idol worship, fetish practices, magic and associations contrary to
          the tenets of CCC,</p>
        <p>  5. Must understand and submit to the tenets, doctrines and mode of worship of the church.</p>
        <p>6. Must be duly ready and prepared for baptism by water immersion</p>
        <br>
          <b><u>REQUIREMENTS AFTER BAPTISM</u></b>
        <br>
        <p> 7. The baptized member becomes a full member of CCC</p>
        <p>8. Must continue to obey the tenets, rules and code of conduct of CCC.</p>
        <p> 9. Should live a committed Christian life and participate faithfully in church activities.</p>
        <p>  10. He/she is fit to join any department in the Church</p>
        <p>  11. Must remain active and committed in preparation for anointment which the CCC tenets describe
          as coming after a further period of worship and commitment.</p>
        </p>